=== Dependent Types Sample ===
--- 1. Single dependent parameter ---
  buf5.Describe() = FixedBuffer<5>
  buf5.GetSize() = 5
--- 2. Multiple dependent parameters ---
  mat.Describe() = Matrix<3,4>
--- 3. Mixed parameter list ---
  tbuf.Describe() = TypedBuffer<16>(value=hello)
--- 4. Struct with dependent parameter ---
  span3.Describe() = FixedSpan<3>
  span3.GetLength() = 3
--- 5. Construction with literal values ---
  buf10.Describe() = FixedBuffer<10>
  buf99.Describe() = FixedBuffer<99>
--- 6. Dependent property access ---
  buf5.GetSize() = 5
  buf10.GetSize() = 10
  IntParam<42>.GetValue() = 42
--- 7. Type identity / type safety ---
  Accepted FixedBuffer<5>
--- 8. Dependent types on abstract types ---
  tiny.GetInfo() = TinyCollection(size=8)
  tiny.GetSize() = 8
--- 9. Dependent types on abstract types ---
  SizedBox<12>.GetCapacity() = 12
--- 10. Dependent types on methods ---
  Repeat<3>: hello
  Repeat<1>: world
--- 11. Inheritance ---
  SmallBuffer : FixedBuffer<10> constructed
  ResizableBuffer<25> constructed
  flex.GetInfo() = FlexCollection<16>(size=16)
--- 12. Generic function accepting any dependent value ---
  Processed buffer of size 7
--- 13. Pattern matching ---
  target is FixedBuffer<5> = true
  target10 is FixedBuffer<10> = true
--- 14. Type aliases with dependent parameter ---
  SmallInt<V:int> = int (alias declared)
--- 15. All allowed value types ---
  IntParam<42>.GetValue() = 42
  IntParam<-1>.GetValue() = -1
  UintParam<100>.Describe() = UintParam<100>
  LongParam<999>.Describe() = LongParam<999>
  UlongParam<500>.Describe() = UlongParam<500>
  ShortParam<7>.Describe() = ShortParam<7>
  UshortParam<200>.Describe() = UshortParam<200>
  ByteParam<255>.Describe() = ByteParam<255>
  SbyteParam<-50>.Describe() = SbyteParam<-50>
  BoolParam<true>.Describe() = BoolParam<True>
  CharParam<'X'>.Describe() = CharParam<X>
--- 16. Dependent property access from outside the type ---
  FixedBuffer<5>.Size = 5
  FiveBuffer.Size (alias) = 5
  SmallBuffer.Size (fixed base) = 10
  ResizableBuffer<25>.Size (forwarded base) = 25, .N = 25
  TinyCollection.Size (abstract base) = 8
  Matrix<3, 4>.Rows * Matrix<3, 4>.Cols = 12
--- 17. Forwarding an int parameter into a long one ---
  NarrowCounter<7> : WideCounter<7>, Remaining(2) = 5
  NarrowCounter<7>.Limit = 7
  as WideCounter<7>: 0 left; is WideCounter<7> = True, is WideCounter<8> = False
--- 18. Every value a domain holds ---
  byte 255, sbyte -128, ulong 18446744073709551615 (half 9223372036854775807), long -9223372036854775808
  UlongParam<0xFFFF_FFFF_FFFF_FFFF> is UlongParam<18446744073709551615>: UlongParam<18446744073709551615>
--- 19. An alias's own dependent parameter ---
  SmallInt<9>.V (alias of int) = 9
  SizedAlias<6>.Count = 6, through it FixedBuffer<6>.Size = 6
  OuterAlias<4>.Outer (nested forwarding) = 4
  AliasReader<12>.Read() (open forwarding) = 12
  SizedAlias<6> holds FixedBuffer<6>
=== Dependent Types Done ===
